        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Wozniak, Dylan Keefe, Shlomi Lavie, Gvaji, Irakli Charkviani, Nino Katamadze, Sergi Gvarjaladze, Katie Melua, Nika Kocharov, Sophie Villy\n- Bands: Loudspeakers, Marcy Playground, Young Georgian Lolitaz\n- Songs: \"Sex and Candy\", \"It's Saturday\"\n- Topics: rock bands, alternative rock, musical collaborations\n\nFacts:\n- Loudspeakers, stylised as LOUDspeakers, is a Georgian rock band formed in 2009.\n- Marcy Playground is an American alternative rock band whose members are John Wozniak, Dylan Keefe, and Shlomi Lavie.\n- Marcy Playground is best known for the 1997 hit song \"Sex and Candy\".\n- \"It's Saturday\" is the fourth single by the alternative rock band Marcy Playground.\n- Gvaji has worked with Georgian artists and bands including Irakli Charkviani, Nino Katamadze, Sergi Gvarjaladze, Katie Melua, Nika Kocharov & Young Georgian Lolitaz, Loudspeakers, and Sophie Villy.",
